      "text": "STATE VECTOR  y(t)     owned by the driver, overwritten each step\nr = [x, y, z],  v = [vx, vy, vz],  q = [e0, e1, e2, e3],  ω = [ω1, ω2, ω3]\nδ = [δ1 .. δn]   one state per actuated surface, n from config\nφ_rel, φ̇_rel   spin can, experimental_v1 only\n\ntime t         controller cmds u[]   (held constant for 10 steps)",
      "originalText": "STATE VECTOR  y(t)     owned by the driver, overwritten each step\nr = [x, y, z],  v = [vx, vy, vz],  q = [e0, e1, e2, e3],  ω = [ω1, ω2, ω3]\nδ = [δ1 .. δn]   one state per actuated surface, n from config\nφ_rel, φ̇_rel   spin can, experimental_v1 only\n\ntime t         controller cmds u[]   (held constant for 10 steps)",
